---
description: Guardrails for the Tennessee Horse Cremation Hugo site
alwaysApply: true
---
This is a Hugo 0.120.4 extended static site on a Themefisher theme.
It is a LIVE client website. Treat every change as production.

NEVER run git commit, git push, git reset, or any deploy command.
I handle all git operations myself.

NEVER edit anything in public/ or resources/. Those are generated by
the Hugo build and your changes will be overwritten.

NEVER edit files inside themes/. To change theme markup, copy the file
into layouts/ at the same relative path and edit the copy. Hugo's
lookup order will use mine instead.

Make ONE focused change at a time. Before editing more than three
files, stop, explain the plan, and wait for my approval.

Never delete a file. Propose the deletion and let me confirm.

This site uses phone and text contact only. Never add an email address,
a mailto: link, or an email contact form anywhere.
